27573,"Irregular Activity On Your NatWest!!
Dear online service customer This is a security alert from NatWest Online Fraud Prevention about your debit card. We identified activity on your account that may be fraudulent and ask you verify the activity immediately. SIGNING IN Just follow the simple instructions below, and you'll be back online within minutes. You may wish to print this email to help you through the process 1. Visit www.natwest.co.uk/confirm-identity.aspx<br style=""color: RGB(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-c 2. In the 'Activate your Online service' area, enter your username in the 'Username' box. 3. Enter your password in the 'Password' box and click 'Continue'. WHY YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS IS IMPORTANT It's very important that we have your up-to-date email address. This is how we will tell you about changes to the service, or help you get back online quicker if you forget your sign in details. PROTECTING YOUR SECURITY DETAILS Never share any of your personal security details with anyone else - treat them as you would a PIN for a cash machine. If in the future you suspect your password or memorable information has been seen by anyone else, we strongly recommend that you change them. You can do this easily from within the online service. We hope you'll continue to find the online service convenient and simple to use. To find out what's new or to see our useful information on how to get the most from the service, visit www.natwest.co.uk/aboutonline<br style=""color: RGB(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: RGBA Regards Online Helpdesk Please do not reply to this email as we will be unable to respond.",d04,Email and Cloud Services,"GENERAL SETTINGS
