2363,"Your account has been limited
Dear Barclays Client, We recently have determined that different computers have logged into your account, and multiple password failures were present before the login. As a result, your account has been limited. We value a lot the safety of our clients and for these reasons your account has been selected carefully from a huge list as a subject of review. To start using your Barclays account again, all you have to do is to re-confirm your personal details. Once done, your account access will be fully restored. To re-confirm your details please log in from the link below: https://bank.barclays.co.uk/olb/auth/LoginLink.action Log in to your Barclays account. Follow the update process. Your account access will be fully restored within 5 minutes.",d08,Government and Legal Affairs,"GENERAL SETTINGS
