OSITIVERESPONSE TO THIS REQUEST. I AWAIT ANXIOUSLY TO HEAR FROM YOU SO THAT WE WILL DISCUSS THE MODALITIES THIS TRANSACTION.THANKS AND MAY GOD BLESS YOU.YOURS SINCERELY, JESSICA WILLIAMS AND JAMES.",d11,Education and Training,"GENERAL SETTINGS
